WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:29.920
Gemini 4 Hydrogen Ships at $1.50 and $7.50 per million tokens and powers the free tier plus Google Search. This is Models &amp; Agents, Episode 233, Llama.CPP's Version Bump, and Thropics Offering Filing and Copilot Kits OpenBot come after, then things to try. Google on the company blog aimed hydrogen at everyday coding, agentic workflows, and execution tasks across a full 1 million token context window. While carbon and argon

00:00:29.920 --> 00:00:32.900
remain the frontier options for deep architectural judgment.

00:00:33.640 --> 00:00:38.440
Hydrogens surpasses argon on the artificial analysis intelligence index at its default

00:00:38.440 --> 00:00:45.720
high-thinking level, 51 versus 50, and reaches 54 at the highest x-high setting, often completing

00:00:45.720 --> 00:00:47.820
tasks faster than peers in its class.

00:00:48.580 --> 00:00:53.520
An orchestrator tool in Google anti-gravity dynamically switches between carbon and hydrogen,

00:00:53.520 --> 00:00:59.880
Cunning quota use by 24% and finishing 19% faster on terminal bench 4.0.

00:01:00.540 --> 00:01:05.980
After December 1st, carbon and argon double in price while hydrogen stays flat, shifting

00:01:05.980 --> 00:01:09.820
its relative discount from 25% to 75%.

00:01:09.820 --> 00:01:14.700
Hydrogen is also the model that will power paid Google AI Pro and ultra-subscribers

00:01:14.700 --> 00:01:16.040
in Google anti-gravity.

00:01:16.560 --> 00:01:21.660
Hydrogen underperforms on Pelican generation tasks relative to the more expensive variants.

00:01:21.660 --> 00:01:28.014
Lama.CPP, a Reddit post recorded, reached version 1.0.0.

00:01:28.494 --> 00:01:32.894
The bump arrived as a pull request from Maintainer GGE-RNOF.

00:01:33.414 --> 00:01:40.594
Artificial analysis updated the Quinn 3.8-flash-next score to 29, placing it between GPT-6 Luna

00:01:40.594 --> 00:01:44.534
Max at 28 and Claude Haiku 5.5 high at 30.

00:01:45.014 --> 00:01:51.514
That result sits closer to the larger Quinn 3.8 Max variant at 34, then to the 27 billion

00:01:51.514 --> 00:01:58.967
model at 20. Ernie 5.5 Flash Preview launched at 280 billion total parameters with 14 billion

00:01:58.967 --> 00:02:04.987
active. It posed strong results on an aggregate agentic coding index built from 12 coding benchmarks,

00:02:05.467 --> 00:02:14.427
waiting terminal bench version 4.0 at 16%, deep suite version 1.1 at 15%, and frontier code 2.0

00:02:14.427 --> 00:02:21.963
at 11%, and Thropic, in its initial public offering filing, listed more than 11,900 customers

00:02:21.963 --> 00:02:28.423
generating at least $100,000 in trailing 12-month revenue, a greater than 12 times year-over-year

00:02:28.423 --> 00:02:29.643
increase in that cohort.

00:02:30.263 --> 00:02:35.363
The filing also listed a four times computer efficiency gain since the first quarter of 2025.

00:02:36.183 --> 00:02:43.803
Net loss reached $23.3 billion, largely from a $21.9 billion non-cash charge on fair value

00:02:43.803 --> 00:02:47.903
changes for convertible notes, derivative liabilities, and safes.

00:02:48.764 --> 00:02:55.884
A 100 prices a local LMA thread reported have fallen 20-30% since earlier collapse reports,

00:02:56.304 --> 00:03:02.064
as sellers cut quotes to move inventory before Ruben and Blackwell GPUs, which deliver three

00:03:02.064 --> 00:03:04.164
to four times better efficiency per watt.

00:03:04.704 --> 00:03:09.664
Those cards see limited use for inference outside enthusiast and small-scale rental markets.

00:03:09.664 --> 00:03:17.764
Copilot Kit released OpenBot 1.0, Marktech Post notes, and MIT licensed self-hostible AI

00:03:17.764 --> 00:03:22.864
coworker workspace that lets companies bring their own agents, models, and infrastructure.

00:03:23.484 --> 00:03:27.904
Each action a bot takes has to clear a policy check and then lands in an audit trail.

00:03:28.849 --> 00:03:35.529
A CAM agent from Limitless Labs, Design News said, targets computer-aided manufacturing workflows for engineers.

00:03:35.529 --> 00:03:39.909
It is presented as part of a broader series on AI tools for engineers.

00:03:40.529 --> 00:03:48.509
Stratas EXL-3 AMD fork, a local LMA post said, gained 10-20% decode speed on hip kernels,

00:03:48.909 --> 00:03:52.709
and adds optional local expert repacking for CPU-assisted inference.

00:03:53.509 --> 00:04:01.929
Experimental MIMO V2.6 Flash support runs at 25-30 tokens per second on 2 RX-7900 XTX cards,

00:04:01.929 --> 00:04:13.009
with a 2.20 BPW MOPD quant. The 3.05 BPW EXL-3 quant now reaches 87 tokens per second on two GPUs,

00:04:13.369 --> 00:04:21.232
while matching roughly IQ4KXS quality. A machine learning thread showed a LaGora-style legal conflict detector built

00:04:21.232 --> 00:04:28.312
using only NLI or natural language inference and encoder models. Documents get enriched into hierarchical

00:04:28.312 --> 00:04:34.152
article clause trees, then clauses are embedded, non-provisioned text is filtered out, pairs

00:04:34.152 --> 00:04:40.652
above 0.5 cosine similarity get shortlisted, and a re-ranker plus NLI classifier scores

00:04:40.652 --> 00:04:42.172
them for deviations and gaps.

00:04:42.952 --> 00:04:48.892
Paraguise review of Bob Eiger's 2011 and 2022 Disney agreements finished in under 20 seconds

00:04:48.892 --> 00:04:53.192
for the longest sampled pairs, and the work is released under the MIT license.

00:04:53.192 --> 00:05:00.044
Retrieval Augmented Generation, or RAG, lost 40 points towards data science found when

00:05:00.044 --> 00:05:02.864
distracting passages grew to 2.68 million.

00:05:03.404 --> 00:05:09.084
A reproducible test of BM25 embeddings and parent documents shows retrieval performance

00:05:09.084 --> 00:05:14.464
degrades sharply as corpus-sized scales, and that author-written e-vals often overstate

00:05:14.464 --> 00:05:15.924
real-world search quality.

00:05:15.924 --> 00:05:25.657
IBM released experimental Granite 4.13b LLM on Preview and Granite 4.18b LLM on Preview models,

00:05:26.117 --> 00:05:31.877
the hugging phase blog details, trained to consume and generate LLM on Mark Text that explicitly

00:05:31.877 --> 00:05:34.637
tags instructions, data and requirements.

00:05:35.377 --> 00:05:41.257
LLM on is an LLM Native Markup language, an indirect prompt injection success rates fall

00:05:41.257 --> 00:05:46.297
to near zero on some benchmarks, with general capability holding up relative to standard

00:05:46.297 --> 00:05:48.477
granite 4.1 instruct models.

00:05:49.540 --> 00:05:54.380
IncVex maintainer, posting to the machine learning subreddit, proposes a one-dimensional

00:05:54.380 --> 00:06:00.440
convolutional neural network, or CNN, overclosed outlines for node placement, combined with

00:06:00.440 --> 00:06:05.280
a small network that predicts full silhouettes as sign distance fields, so hidden shapes

00:06:05.280 --> 00:06:06.000
can be handled.

00:06:06.520 --> 00:06:11.080
Nothing is trained yet, and the maintainer is looking for prior work on a modal infilling

00:06:11.080 --> 00:06:17.980
and artist-style node conditioning. Elsewhere, an AI agent pitched a story to CBC Quebec, Yahoo

00:06:17.980 --> 00:06:23.280
News Canada said, and the newsroom replied to see what would happen. Infrastructure needs

00:06:23.280 --> 00:06:30.840
change when agents become enterprise users, ETCIO argued. AI agents, Gizmodo noted, can't find

00:06:30.840 --> 00:06:37.420
anyone to help yet. eBay used data center and workstation GPU listings, a local llama post-ranked

00:06:37.420 --> 00:06:39.860
by dollars per gigabyte of VRAM this week.

00:06:40.400 --> 00:06:43.940
Gemma 3 builds a linearly decodable spatial map from text,

00:06:44.340 --> 00:06:45.840
but its answers never read it,

00:06:45.980 --> 00:06:47.340
a machine learning thread found.

00:06:47.920 --> 00:06:48.920
Another post asked,

00:06:49.060 --> 00:06:51.440
what if Nureps, ICML and ICLR

00:06:51.440 --> 00:06:54.040
caped accepted papers at 1000 each?

00:06:54.560 --> 00:06:58.440
CVPR 2027 circulated an author enrollment form,

00:06:58.940 --> 00:07:00.020
a further post called

00:07:00.020 --> 00:07:03.240
creating author burdens to reduce paper submissions stupid.

00:07:04.273 --> 00:07:07.053
In Google AI Studio or the Gemini API,

00:07:07.053 --> 00:07:14.313
buy, run Gemini 4 Hydrogen on everyday coding against Claude Haiku 5.5 or GPT-6 Luna

00:07:14.313 --> 00:07:15.293
at current pricing.

00:07:15.953 --> 00:07:20.733
The legal conflict detector cookbook can take your own NLI or re-ranker models for

00:07:20.733 --> 00:07:25.353
clause-level pairwise review on contract pairs without quadratic generative calls.

00:07:25.813 --> 00:07:34.493
On RDNA 3 hardware, load the Strata EXL-3 AMD fork with the 3.05 BPW EXL-3 Quant and

00:07:34.493 --> 00:07:37.553
and compare decode against standard GGUF on your workload.

00:07:38.133 --> 00:07:44.213
On the Granite 4.1 Preview models, try LLMO-1 tagged prompts that separate instructions

00:07:44.213 --> 00:07:48.113
from retrieved data and measure injection resistance on your own test cases.

00:07:48.733 --> 00:07:54.093
Overlapping SVG logos are a quick test of the open-source A-model raster-to-vector prototype

00:07:54.393 --> 00:07:58.693
to see how the sign distance field approach recovers hidden shapes before you train your

00:07:58.693 --> 00:07:59.573
own small network.

00:07:59.573 --> 00:08:05.667
HyperXcel will demonstrate its LPU inference system at SC-26 later this month.

00:08:06.167 --> 00:08:12.667
CVPR-2027 wants that enrollment in by the abstract deadline on top of an open-review profile.

